@startuml
title Architecture de deploiement locale

cloud "GitHub Repository" as GitHub {
  artifact "README_DEMARRAGE.md" as Readme
  artifact "requirements.txt" as Requirements
  artifact "requirements_finetuning.txt" as FTRequirements
  artifact ".env.example" as EnvExample
  artifact "docs/uml/" as UMLDocs
}

node "PC utilisateur Windows" {
  node "VS Code" {
    artifact "Projet Python\nconops_ai_platform_v2" as Code
    artifact ".env local\nnon versionne" as Env
  }
  node "Python .venv" {
    component "Streamlit\napp.py" as Streamlit
    component "Pipeline\nsrc/" as Pipeline
  }
  database "data/" {
    artifact "rules/conops_opscon_rules_v3.json" as Rules
    artifact "reference_docs/*.pdf" as References
    artifact "gold_standards/*.json" as Gold
  }
  database "outputs/run_id/\ngenere localement\nnon versionne GitHub" {
    artifact "experiments_summary.csv" as Summary
    artifact "rule_assessment_detailed.csv" as RuleCSV
    artifact "rag_chunks_used.csv" as RagCSV
    artifact "reports Markdown / JSON" as Reports
    artifact "models .sysml" as SysML
    artifact "graphes HTML" as Graphs
    artifact "expert_validation.csv" as Validation
    artifact "scientific_report.md\nsection_classification.csv" as ScientificOutputs
    artifact "sysml_graph_*.html\ntraceability_edges.csv" as SysMLGraphOutputs
  }
  node "Ollama local" {
    component "Modeles locaux" as Ollama
  }
  database "models/" {
    artifact "conops-lora/\nnon pousse sur GitHub\nsauf Git LFS ou telechargement separe" as Lora
    artifact "model_registry.json\nconditionnel" as Registry
  }
  cloud "OpenAI API\noptionnelle" as OpenAI
  node "Index vectoriel local" {
    database "ChromaDB persistent\ndata/chroma_db" as Index
  }
}

GitHub --> Code : clone / pull
EnvExample --> Env : copie locale
Requirements --> Pipeline : dependances principales
FTRequirements --> Lora : dependances optionnelles
Code --> Streamlit
Streamlit --> Pipeline
Pipeline --> Rules
Pipeline --> References
Pipeline --> Gold
Pipeline --> Index
Pipeline --> Ollama
Pipeline --> Lora : C6/C7 si disponible
Registry --> Pipeline
Pipeline --> OpenAI
Pipeline --> Summary
Pipeline --> RuleCSV
Pipeline --> RagCSV
Pipeline --> Reports
Pipeline --> SysML
Pipeline --> Graphs
Pipeline --> ScientificOutputs
Pipeline --> SysMLGraphOutputs
Streamlit --> Validation

note bottom
Chaque execution est tracee par run_id et hashes.
La validation SysML actuelle est heuristique.
Les resultats restent soumis a validation humaine.
Le fichier .env et les cles API ne sont pas envoyes sur GitHub.
outputs/run_id/ est genere localement et non versionne.
models/conops-lora/ n'est pas pousse sur GitHub,
sauf via Git LFS ou un telechargement separe.
end note
@enduml
